      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "[\\[18\\]](#part1333.html#w18) 白居易《长恨歌》中句：“七月七日长生殿，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Note [18]: A line from Bai Juyi's Song of Everlasting Sorrow says: On the seventh day of the seventh month, in the Hall of Longevity,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00408",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "夜半无人私语时：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "at midnight, when no one was there, they whispered privately to each other:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00408",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "在天愿作比翼鸟，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "In heaven, may we become birds flying wing to wing,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00408",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "在地愿为连理枝。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and on earth, may we become branches joined together as one.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
